      "args": {},
      "justification": "AHA ACLS guidelines mandate evaluation of reversible causes (Hs and Ts) in asystole/PEA to identify and treat underlying etiology. Vitals showing HR 80 and BP 120/80 with pulseless presentation suggests possible PEA or artifact \u2014 reversible causes must be assessed."
    },
